{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262nUncArEHn1795499859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>滙控管理層重申，本港業務「主場地位」無可替代。</p><p></p><p>滙控亞洲及中東地區聯席行政總裁廖宜建撰文提到，近日有傳媒指滙控計劃「對沖」香港是誤導，強調對香港信心堅定。自集團成立以來，香港一直是亞洲以至全球業務不可替代核心，形容「自己主場是無法對沖」。</p><p></p><p>文章又指，本港連接全球第二大經濟體和世界其他市場，也貢獻集團約四分一稅前利潤，強調香港不僅是集團決策中心，也是推出創新方案的基地。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.103949+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:14.420869+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:33.526400+00:00","content_hash":"6f773f6fa5bdad3aefcdc10b6fd9dad8bca981df7e3e701049809f6aa08a3233","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.103949+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}